sentences.text:
While imposing conditions, learned court in seisin over the matter shall impose the additional following conditions:
i) shall not cooperate with the investigation and appear before the I.O. as and when required for the purpose of investigation;
 ii) shall not threaten, influence, harass or  terrorise the informant or any of the  prosecution witnesses in any manner  whatsoever;
 iii) shall not tamper with the prosecution  witnesses;
 iv) shall appear before the trial court on each Ranjan Naik vs State Of Odisha .....

